00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:16,400
to help steer the Scouts towards doing what Scouts do,

392
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:18,400
And in the process

393
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:20,400
I stumbled across the National Outdoor Awards.

