431
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:42,400
Let's do the stuff that Scouts do,

432
00:23:42,400 --> 00:23:44,400
whether we are incentivizing it

433
00:23:44,400 --> 00:23:47,400
with awards and recognition or not,

434
00:23:47,400 --> 00:23:50,400
because, hey, it's the stuff that Scouts do.

435
00:23:50,400 --> 00:23:52,400
So this is not very interesting

436
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:54,400
or exciting advice. right,

437
00:23:54,400 --> 00:23:56,400
I'm not real big on that kind of incentive,

438
00:23:56,400 --> 00:23:59,400
but I know folks use this type of thing very effectively.

439
00:23:59,400 --> 00:24:02,400
I certainly don't have anything against it,

440
00:24:02,400 --> 00:24:06,400
